    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d91">

                <pb facs="0156" n="64" sameAs="frus:frus1943CairoTehran/pg64"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President to the Ambassador in the United
                        Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>)<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d91-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hyde
                                Park</hi></placeName>?] <date calendar="gregorian" when="1943-11-02"
                            >2 November 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Personal and secret from the President to Winant.</p>
                <p>You are absolutely right. I will let you know as soon as date can be arranged and
                    you would meet us in North Africa.</p>
                <p>It will be good to see you again.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Roosevelt</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d91-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d91-f1-content">
                <p>Sent to the United States Naval Attach, London, via the White House Map Room and
                    Navy channels.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
